# rustfmt pins newline_style = "Unix", and Windows checkouts default to core.autocrlf=true.
# Without this, `cargo fmt --check` fails on every file on Windows — locally and on CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Said outright rather than left to `text=auto`'s heuristic. An icon that git decided was text
# would have its 0x0d bytes rewritten on checkout, and the corruption would show up as an
# executable with no icon rather than as anything that fails to build.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
